@startuml
title FE-12 Configure and Save Design Version
actor Member
participant WorkshopRingDesignController
participant WorkshopRingDesignApplicationService
participant DesignRuleFacade
database RingDesignRepository
database RingDesignIdempotencyRecordRepository
Member -> WorkshopRingDesignController : save model/blank parameters
WorkshopRingDesignController -> WorkshopRingDesignApplicationService : validate Member, key and version
WorkshopRingDesignApplicationService -> DesignRuleFacade : validate catalogue options and limits
DesignRuleFacade --> WorkshopRingDesignApplicationService : valid snapshot and rules version
WorkshopRingDesignApplicationService -> RingDesignRepository : save immutable version
WorkshopRingDesignApplicationService -> RingDesignIdempotencyRecordRepository : record command result
WorkshopRingDesignController --> Member : SAVED design and safe summary
note over Member,WorkshopRingDesignController
Guest can preview locally but protected save requires sign-in.
end note
@enduml
